  title: N I P P O N
  button: NIPPON
  subtitle: ONIGIRI / KOKESHI / DARUMA / SHINKANSEN / UDON / MANEKI-NEKO
  intro: Six things from one country, one for each part of the islands. Fill the
    map with their shadows.
  hint: The rice ball is the north island. The bullet train runs west along the coast;
    the lucky cat waves from the south-west.
  complete: 'NIPPON

    Rice in the north, dolls and trains through the middle,

    a
    bowl of udon and a waving cat in the south.'
